msgid "这些入口各自维护调用上下文、存储、deadline、硬件退出与失败后的责任；概述页不再 复制 pin／DMA 表或公共签名。修改一种模式时，同时核对其资源冲突、消费者、图示与 译文。分组回归只证明所执行的源码和范围，不自动合并成全候选或实板通过。"
msgstr "Each entry maintains its call context, storage, deadlines, hardware withdrawal and failure responsibilities. Overview pages do not duplicate pin / DMA tables or public signatures. When changing a mode, check its resource conflicts, consumers, diagrams and translations together. Grouped regressions establish only the executed source and scope; they do not automatically combine into whole-candidate or physical acceptance."

msgid "旧专项 CSV、实现和执行记录保留原始身份，范围从 [固定重构前源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/design) 追溯；不据旧计数或退役平台文档扩大当前支持。"
msgstr "Old specialized CSV files, implementations and execution records retain their original identities. Trace their scope through the [fixed pre-refactor source](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/design). Old counts and retired-platform documentation do not expand current support."

