msgid "从本页选择要维护的合同：先核对[精确型号与模式](../delivery/support.md)、Board 和 资源责任，再进入对应源码。设计页、公共头和厂商 SDK 不单独建立新型号、软件候选 或物理资格；新增料号的内部 CRC 参考也不扩大 F407 专属模式的执行范围。 当前 physical HIL 为 `not_executed`。"
msgstr "Choose a maintenance contract here after checking [exact devices and modes](../delivery/support.md), Board facts and resource ownership. Design pages, public headers and vendor SDKs alone do not establish new parts, software candidates or physical qualification. Internal-CRC references for added parts do not expand the execution scope of F407-specific modes. Physical HIL remains `not_executed`."
